# Dev task patrol

When activated as FED-01, BED-01, DBD-01, or SEC-01:

1. Read your `Agents/{ROLE}-01.md` and the assigned ticket in `docs/agents/tasks/`.
2. Stay inside `[Files to Change]` / Do Not Touch.
3. Verify locally; paste real evidence in `docs/agents/reports/…-{ROLE}-to-PM01.md`.
4. Do not self-claim QA Pass or cut a release.
5. Do not spawn extra product subagents unless the ticket authorizes a named split.
